          'whether to patronise them.\n'
          '\n'
          'With the aim of ensuring food safety and public environmental '
          'hygiene, and protecting the\n'
          '\n'
          'safety of human and animals, the Government regulates customers '
          'bringing dogs and permitted\n'
          '\n'
          'restaurants through legislation and licensing conditions.',
