               'filetype': 'application/pdf',
               'languages': ['eng'],
               'last_modified': '2026-10-10T22:34:42',
               'orig_elements': '',
               'page_number': 13},
  'text': 'it outside for some exercise, and return to his seat after the dog '
          'has calmed down.\n'
          '\n'
          'If the situation persists, it may indicate that the dog is not fit '
