               'languages': ['eng'],
               'last_modified': '2026-10-10T22:35:06',
               'orig_elements': '',
               'page_number': 1},
  'text': 'Introduction\n'
          '\n'
          '1.1\n'
          '\n'
          'The Food Business Regulation (Cap. 132X) has been amended to allow '
          'dogs to enter\n'
          '\n'
          'food premises permitted to admit dogs (i.e. permitted restaurants) '
          'under specified circumstances. Any person engaged in a food '
          'business1 and persons bringing dogs must comply with the statutory '
          'requirements (see Annex 2). Restaurant licensees must\n'
          '\n'
          'also comply with the licensing conditions (see Annex 3). The first '
          'part of the',
  'type': 'CompositeElement'},
 {'element_id': '5c34bbcf-aecb-4e68-bce6-fd5b18af013a',
  'metadata': {'file_directory': './KnowledgeFiles',
               'filename': 'Guidelines on Good Practices and Behaviour for '
                           'Dog-Friendly Restaurants (Restaurant '
