               'last_modified': '2026-10-10T22:35:06',
               'orig_elements': '',
               'page_number': 1},
  'text': 'House rules\n'
          '\n'
          '1.2\n'
          '\n'
          'Restaurant operators may devise their own house rules and '
          'operational arrangements\n'
          '\n'
          'according to their needs and specify the customer-related part as '
          '“Notes to Customers”,\n'
          '\n'
          'including but not limited to matters such as whether dog-friendly '
          'zones or sessions will\n'
          '\n'
          'be designated, whether dogs are allowed to sit on customer seats, '
          'and whether a cleaning\n'
          '\n'
          'fee will be charged if a dog soils the premises. If “Notes to '
          'Customers” are in place,',
  'type': 'CompositeElement'},
 {'element_id': 'b6e6d127-f995-4e6d-805a-f86731c300a7',
  'metadata': {'file_directory': './KnowledgeFiles',
               'filename': 'Guidelines on Good Practices and Behaviour for '
                           'Dog-Friendly Restaurants (Restaurant '
                           'Operators).pdf',
               'filetype': 'application/pdf',
               'languages': ['eng'],
               'last_modified': '2026-10-10T22:35:06',
               'orig_elements': '',
               'page_number': 1},
  'text': 'they should be displayed at the entrance to or other conspicuous '
          'places in the permitted\n'
          '\n'
          'restaurants, or should be clearly explained to customers beforehand '
          'through\n'
          '\n'
          'appropriate means, such as menus, the ordering system and the '
          'restaurant’s social media\n'
          '\n'
          'accounts, to avoid misunderstandings and disputes.\n'
          '\n'
          '1.3\n'
          '\n'
          'The list of permitted restaurants on the FEHD’s dedicated webpage '
          'will be updated from\n'
          '\n'
          'time to time. To enhance information transparency, permitted '
          'restaurants should',
  'type': 'CompositeElement'},
