          'employed or assigned to engage in the food business.\n'
          '\n'
          '1\n'
          '\n'
          'Arrangements for dog admission to permitted restaurants\n'
          '\n'
          '1.4\n'
          '\n'
          'Restaurant operators should make clear arrangements to assist in '
          'ensuring that dogs\n'
          '\n'
          'entering the premises comply with the relevant statutory '
          'requirements and licensing',
  'type': 'CompositeElement'},
