          '\n'
          'mobile app.\n'
          '\n'
          '1.5\n'
          '\n'
          'For effective control of their dogs, each adult diner should not '
          'bring more than two dogs.\n'
          '\n'
          'Restaurant operators may set an upper limit on the total number of '
          'dogs admitted to the\n'
          '\n'
          'premises at any one time according to the actual conditions of the '
          'premises, such as\n'
          '\n'
          'area, seating spacing, customer flow and the main types of dishes '
          'served (e.g.',
  'type': 'CompositeElement'},
