               'orig_elements': '',
               'page_number': 2},
  'text': 'refreshments or congee).\n'
          '\n'
          '1.6\n'
          '\n'
          'Restaurant operators may, as needed, designate by themselves '
          'specific sessions and days\n'
          '\n'
          '(e.g. specific sessions each day or weekends only) during which '
          'dogs are admitted.\n'
          '\n'
          'However, it must be noted that even during non-dog-admission '
          'sessions/days, permitted\n'
          '\n'
          'restaurants are still required to display designated signage at a '
