               'orig_elements': '',
               'page_number': 2},
  'text': 'more open, as a dog-friendly zone, and shade facilities may also be '
          'provided as needed.\n'
          '\n'
          '2\n'
          '\n'
          '1.8\n'
          '\n'
          'Restaurant operators may, based on factors such as the actual '
